<title>SRI LANKA: United Motors Q1 net rises 22 pct.</title>
<headline>United Motors Q1 net rises 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the three months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 Q1 96/97	    Q1 95/96</p>
<p>    Turnover		  272.90    vs	205.59</p>
<p>    Net profit		 23.94    vs	 19.67</p>
<p>    Tax provision	    14.89    vs	 14.90</p>
<p>NOTE - United Motors Lanka Ltd is the sole agent for Japan's Mitsubishi Motors in Sri Lanka.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
